## 🔑 KEY DECISIONS / RESOLUTIONS
- **Auth helper version matching:** Resolved `createRouteHandlerClient` issues by shifting to unified `createServerClient` and `createBrowserClient` exports of the wrapper package `@supabase/auth-helpers-nextjs` v0.15.0.
- **Client Component headers separation:** Split `supabase.ts` helper into client/server variants to avoid compilation failures when next/headers is imported on browser components.
- **Zod 4.x Record typing:** Updated `z.record(z.unknown())` to `z.record(z.string(), z.unknown())` to satisfy compiler signature requirements.
